 "note": "S, 13 platforms, open, inward. A round ring of four platforms on the hub's diagonals, joined by curved quarter arcs, circles a 4-way grinder hub (a rotor with no fixed deck: its V of two bridges turns from the upper pair to the lower pair, killing what is on it). Each home's two pockets land on the ring's near side; a high platform over the top pocket drops onto the ring too. Mirrored left / right (2026-11-01, was point-symmetric). Survivor ring: the hub and the ring.",
